By Lemmas \ref{LemmaKSymm2} and \ref{LemmaThetaC2} (namely, $\theta\equiv (g+1)V-D/2$) we find

\begin{lemma}
\source{chabauty-coleman-bound-surfaces}
\notready\label{LemmaThetaK} $(\theta.K_{C^{(2)}})=2g(g-2)$.
